Error [E0956]: A `comptime loop` source is not a compile-time list
  --> tests/ui/template_loop_noncomptime_source.jet:1:20
    |
  1 | comptime loop T in 1 {
    |                    ^
 Why: `comptime loop` expands one item template for each value in its source list
 Fix: Use a reflected/comptime list such as `T.$fields`, or a closed type list like `[TypeA, TypeB]`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0956
